Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 04:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] tests: add FAPO control server unit tests and interop
 fixture

* fapo_control_server_test: gtest of the telemetry store (seqlock
  consistency under concurrent publish/read) and of the FAPO v1
  protocol end-to-end against a real server instance (hello, ping,
  telemetry, apply validation and clamping, reset, error handling).

* fapo_interop_server: test fixture binary that instantiates the real
  control server and publishes deterministic snapshots, used to verify
  the wire compatibility with external FAPO clients (e.g. the Python
  SRSRANAdapter).
